msgstr "**打开：** 创建掩膜 → 模型库。"

msgid ":doc:`API reference </api/spacr/model_zoo/index>`."
msgstr ":doc:`API 参考 </api/spacr/model_zoo/index>`。"

msgid "`Module tutorial <tutorials/#lesson=22_model_zoo>`__."
msgstr "`模块教程 <tutorials/#lesson=22_model_zoo>`__。"

msgid "Curate"
msgstr "校正"

msgid "Correct labels and track assignments while retaining a record of the edits."
msgstr "修正标签和轨迹分配，同时保留编辑记录。"

msgid "**Open:** Make Masks → Curate."
msgstr "**打开：** 创建掩膜 → 校正。"

msgid "**Linked time-series objects** — Tracked labels and frame/object associations from the time-series project, with frame interval and units."
msgstr "**已关联的时间序列对象** — 时间序列项目中的跟踪标签及帧与对象关联，附带帧间隔和单位。"

msgid ":doc:`API reference </api/spacr/qt/screens/curate/index>`."
msgstr ":doc:`API 参考 </api/spacr/qt/screens/curate/index>`。"

msgid "`Module tutorial <tutorials/#lesson=42_curate>`__."
msgstr "`模块教程 <tutorials/#lesson=42_curate>`__。"

msgid "Napari Bridge"
msgstr "napari 桥接"

msgid "Send the matching image/labels to napari and import the revised labels back with field identity preserved."
msgstr "将匹配的图像和标签发送到 napari，再导回修改后的标签，同时保留视野标识。"

msgid "**Open:** Make Masks → Napari Bridge."
msgstr "**打开：** 创建掩膜 → napari 桥接。"

msgid ":doc:`API reference </api/spacr/napari_bridge/index>`."
msgstr ":doc:`API 参考 </api/spacr/napari_bridge/index>`。"

msgid "`Module tutorial <tutorials/#lesson=46_napari_bridge>`__."
msgstr "`模块教程 <tutorials/#lesson=46_napari_bridge>`__。"

msgid "Import Images"
msgstr "导入图像"

msgid "Review field identities, image channels and optional external masks before writing a separate project. Image-only imports still need segmentation before measurement."
msgstr "写入独立项目前，核查视野标识、图像通道和可选的外部掩膜。仅导入图像时，测量前仍需分割。"

msgid "**Open:** Import → Import Images."
msgstr "**打开：** 导入 → 导入图像。"

msgid ":ref:`Mask <workflow-module-mask>`: Use imported image planes and identities; image-only imports still need segmentation."
msgstr ":ref:`Mask <workflow-module-mask>`: 使用导入的图像平面和标识；仅导入图像时仍需分割。"

msgid ":doc:`API reference </api/spacr/image_import/index>`."
msgstr ":doc:`API 参考 </api/spacr/image_import/index>`。"

msgid "`Module tutorial <tutorials/#lesson=74_import_images>`__."
msgstr "`模块教程 <tutorials/#lesson=74_import_images>`__。"

msgid "Barcode QC"
msgstr "条形码质控"

msgid "Inspect mapping depth, coverage, collisions and positional effects before guide-count filtering."
msgstr "过滤向导计数前，检查映射深度、覆盖度、冲突和位置效应。"

msgid "**Open:** Map Barcodes → Barcode QC."
msgstr "**打开：** 映射条形码 → 条形码质控。"

msgid ":ref:`Map Barcodes <workflow-module-map_barcodes>`: Check mapping and coverage before guide filtering."
msgstr ":ref:`Map Barcodes <workflow-module-map_barcodes>`: 过滤向导计数前检查映射情况和覆盖度。"

msgid ":doc:`API reference </api/spacr/sequencing_qc/index>`."
msgstr ":doc:`API 参考 </api/spacr/sequencing_qc/index>`。"

