msgstr "`模块教程 <tutorials/#lesson=47_barcode_qc>`__。"

msgid "Image Scatter"
msgstr "图像散点图"

msgid "Plot selected measurement columns with object-crop inspection."
msgstr "绘制所选测量列，并结合对象裁剪图像进行检查。"

msgid "**Open:** Image UMAP → Image Scatter."
msgstr "**打开：** 图像 UMAP → 图像散点图。"

msgid ":doc:`API reference </api/spacr/qt/screens/image_scatter/index>`."
msgstr ":doc:`API 参考 </api/spacr/qt/screens/image_scatter/index>`。"

msgid "`Module tutorial <tutorials/#lesson=55_image_scatter>`__."
msgstr "`模块教程 <tutorials/#lesson=55_image_scatter>`__。"

msgid "PCA"
msgstr "PCA"

msgid "Inspect principal components and feature loadings for the selected measured objects."
msgstr "检查所选已测量对象的主成分和特征载荷。"

msgid "**Open:** Image UMAP → PCA."
msgstr "**打开：** 图像 UMAP → PCA。"

msgid ":doc:`API reference </api/spacr/qt/screens/pca/index>`."
msgstr ":doc:`API 参考 </api/spacr/qt/screens/pca/index>`。"

msgid "`Module tutorial <tutorials/#lesson=60_pca>`__."
msgstr "`模块教程 <tutorials/#lesson=60_pca>`__。"

msgid "Volcano Explorer"
msgstr "火山图浏览器"

msgid "Open a saved regression result and inspect effect sizes, adjusted significance and individual hit records."
msgstr "打开已保存的回归结果，检查效应大小、经校正的显著性和各项命中记录。"

msgid "**Open:** Regression → Volcano Explorer."
msgstr "**打开：** 回归 → 火山图浏览器。"

msgid ":ref:`Regression <workflow-module-regression>`: Inspect saved effects and adjusted significance."
msgstr ":ref:`Regression <workflow-module-regression>`: 检查保存的效应和经校正的显著性。"

msgid ":doc:`API reference </api/spacr/volcano_style/index>`."
msgstr ":doc:`API 参考 </api/spacr/volcano_style/index>`。"

msgid "`Module tutorial <tutorials/#lesson=72_volcano_explorer>`__."
msgstr "`模块教程 <tutorials/#lesson=72_volcano_explorer>`__。"

msgid "Hit List"
msgstr "命中列表"

msgid "Filter and rank saved hits with their effects, FDR and guide agreement."
msgstr "根据效应、FDR 和向导间一致性过滤并排序已保存的命中结果。"

msgid "**Open:** Regression → Hit List."
msgstr "**打开：** 回归 → 命中列表。"

msgid ":ref:`Regression <workflow-module-regression>`: Inspect ranked hits and guide agreement."
msgstr ":ref:`Regression <workflow-module-regression>`: 检查排序后的命中结果和向导间一致性。"

msgid ":doc:`API reference </api/spacr/qt/screens/hit_list/index>`."
msgstr ":doc:`API 参考 </api/spacr/qt/screens/hit_list/index>`。"

msgid "`Module tutorial <tutorials/#lesson=48_hit_list>`__."
msgstr "`模块教程 <tutorials/#lesson=48_hit_list>`__。"

msgid "Methods & Results"
msgstr "方法与结果"

msgid "Draft methods/results text from recorded settings and results; review every claim before publication."
msgstr "根据记录的设置和结果起草方法与结果文本；发表前核查每项论断。"

msgid "**Open:** Regression → Methods & Results."
msgstr "**打开：** 回归 → 方法与结果。"

msgid ":ref:`Regression <workflow-module-regression>`: Review exported prose and every traced result."
msgstr ":ref:`Regression <workflow-module-regression>`: 审核导出的文字和每项可追溯结果。"

msgid ":doc:`API reference </api/spacr/methods_export/index>`."
msgstr ":doc:`API 参考 </api/spacr/methods_export/index>`。"

msgid "`Module tutorial <tutorials/#lesson=49_methods_results>`__."
msgstr "`模块教程 <tutorials/#lesson=49_methods_results>`__。"

msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr "诊断"

msgid "Inspect the diagnostic panels saved by the chosen regression run; distinguish missing diagnostics from passed assumptions."
msgstr "检查所选回归运行保存的诊断面板；区分缺少诊断与假设已通过检查。"

msgid "**Open:** Regression → Diagnostics."
msgstr "**打开：** 回归 → 诊断。"

msgid ":ref:`Regression <workflow-module-regression>`: Open the diagnostics actually written by this run."
msgstr ":ref:`Regression <workflow-module-regression>`: 打开本次运行实际写出的诊断结果。"

msgid ":doc:`API reference </api/spacr/qt/screens/regression/index>`."
msgstr ":doc:`API 参考 </api/spacr/qt/screens/regression/index>`。"

msgid "`Module tutorial <tutorials/#lesson=75_regression_diagnostics>`__."
msgstr "`模块教程 <tutorials/#lesson=75_regression_diagnostics>`__。"

msgid "Illumination"
msgstr "照明"

msgid "Estimate and apply flat-field correction at configured stages. Keep corrected display values distinct from raw measurements and record the applied policy."
msgstr "在配置的阶段估计并应用平场校正。区分校正后的显示值与原始测量值，并记录所用策略。"

msgid "**Open:** Measure → Illumination."
msgstr "**打开：** 测量 → 照明。"

msgid ":doc:`API reference </api/spacr/illumination/index>`."
msgstr ":doc:`API 参考 </api/spacr/illumination/index>`。"

msgid "`Module tutorial <tutorials/#lesson=43_illumination>`__."
msgstr "`模块教程 <tutorials/#lesson=43_illumination>`__。"

msgid "AnnData Export"
msgstr "导出 AnnData"

msgid "Export an AnnData .h5ad file with object metadata and measured features for downstream single-cell analysis."
msgstr "导出包含对象元数据和实测特征的 AnnData .h5ad 文件，用于后续单细胞分析。"

msgid "**Open:** Measure → AnnData Export."
msgstr "**打开：** 测量 → 导出 AnnData。"

msgid "**AnnData export** — An exported .h5ad file containing measured features and object metadata."
msgstr "**AnnData 导出** — 导出的 .h5ad 文件，包含实测特征和对象元数据。"

msgid ":ref:`Measure <workflow-module-measure>`: Export compatible feature and metadata columns."
msgstr ":ref:`Measure <workflow-module-measure>`: 导出兼容的特征列和元数据列。"

msgid ":doc:`API reference </api/spacr/anndata_export/index>`."
msgstr ":doc:`API 参考 </api/spacr/anndata_export/index>`。"

msgid "`Module tutorial <tutorials/#lesson=59_anndata_export>`__."
msgstr "`模块教程 <tutorials/#lesson=59_anndata_export>`__。"

msgid "Motility Assay"
msgstr "运动性分析"

msgid "Inspect track speed and infection-related measurements with an explicit frame interval and pixel calibration."
msgstr "结合明确的帧间隔和像素标定，检查轨迹速度及感染相关测量值。"

msgid "**Open:** Measure → Motility Assay."
msgstr "**打开：** 测量 → 运动性分析。"

msgid ":ref:`Timelapse <workflow-module-timelapse>`: Supply frame interval and pixel calibration."
msgstr ":ref:`Timelapse <workflow-module-timelapse>`: 提供帧间隔和像素标定。"

msgid ":ref:`Measure <workflow-module-measure>`: Combine measured objects with matching tracks."
msgstr ":ref:`Measure <workflow-module-measure>`: 将已测量对象与匹配的轨迹关联。"

msgid ":doc:`API reference </api/spacr/timelapse/index>`."
msgstr ":doc:`API 参考 </api/spacr/timelapse/index>`。"

msgid "`Module tutorial <tutorials/#lesson=18_motility>`__."
msgstr "`模块教程 <tutorials/#lesson=18_motility>`__。"

msgid "Timelapse"
msgstr "延时成像"

msgid "Open Timelapse within Mask to segment and link objects across ordered frames; inspect links before downstream motility analysis."
msgstr "在 Mask 中打开 Timelapse，对有序帧中的对象进行分割和关联；开展后续运动性分析前先检查关联。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Lineage exports retain generation times in frames and add ``generation_time_hours`` with calibrated summary statistics. Supply a positive ``frame_interval_s`` or complete, increasing ``time_s`` values in the tracks table. If both are present, they must agree; irregular timestamps are supported without a fixed interval. Missing calibration and incomplete cell cycles have no generation time in hours. Exported tables record the calibration source and units. The tree axis and Newick branch lengths remain in frames."
msgstr "谱系导出保留以帧为单位的世代时间，并添加 ``generation_time_hours`` 及经过校准的汇总统计量。请提供正数 ``frame_interval_s``，或在轨迹表中提供完整、递增的 ``time_s`` 值。如果两者都存在，则必须一致；不设固定间隔时可使用不规则时间戳。缺少校准或细胞周期不完整时，不提供以小时为单位的世代时间。导出表会记录校准来源和单位。树的坐标轴和 Newick 分支长度仍以帧为单位。"

msgid "**Open:** Mask → Timelapse."
msgstr "**打开：** 掩膜 → 延时成像。"

msgid ":ref:`Mask <workflow-module-mask>`: Enable the nested time-series route before generating linked labels."
msgstr ":ref:`Mask <workflow-module-mask>`: 生成关联标签前，启用嵌套的时间序列路径。"

msgid ":ref:`Measure <workflow-module-measure>`: Use the time-series project with stable frame/object identities."
msgstr ":ref:`Measure <workflow-module-measure>`: 使用具有稳定帧和对象标识的时间序列项目。"

msgid ":ref:`Motility Assay <workflow-module-motility>`: Supply frame interval and pixel calibration."
msgstr ":ref:`Motility Assay <workflow-module-motility>`: 提供帧间隔和像素标定。"

msgid "`Module tutorial <tutorials/#lesson=17_timelapse>`__."
msgstr "`模块教程 <tutorials/#lesson=17_timelapse>`__。"

msgid "OPS"
msgstr "OPS"

msgid "Use sequencing-cycle images and phenotype alignment to decode barcodes per nucleus. Aggregate/join the decoded identities to compatible phenotype inputs before Regression; the OPS database is not a drop-in FASTQ count CSV."
msgstr "使用测序轮次图像和表型对齐，为每个细胞核解码条形码。在 Regression 前，将解码标识汇总或关联到兼容的表型输入；OPS 数据库不能直接替代 FASTQ 计数 CSV。"

msgid "**Open:** Mask → OPS."
msgstr "**打开：** 掩膜 → OPS。"

msgid ":ref:`Align & Stitch <workflow-module-align>`: Carry tile coordinates and original sequencing cycles into OPS; a flattened mosaic alone is insufficient."
msgstr ":ref:`Align & Stitch <workflow-module-align>`: 将图块坐标和原始测序轮次信息一并传入 OPS；只有展平的拼接图像并不足够。"

msgid ":ref:`Regression <workflow-module-regression>`: Join/aggregate decoded objects to phenotype and guide inputs explicitly before Regression; this is not a direct CSV handoff."
msgstr ":ref:`Regression <workflow-module-regression>`: 在 Regression 前，将解码对象与表型和向导输入明确关联或汇总；这不是直接传递 CSV 文件。"

msgid ":doc:`API reference </api/spacr/ops_engine/index>`."
msgstr ":doc:`API 参考 </api/spacr/ops_engine/index>`。"

msgid "`Module tutorial <tutorials/#lesson=76_ops>`__."
msgstr "`模块教程 <tutorials/#lesson=76_ops>`__。"

msgid "Classifier Evaluation"
msgstr "分类器评估"

msgid "Inspect held-out predictions, calibration and split/leakage evidence for the matching classifier."
msgstr "检查匹配分类器的留出集预测、校准以及数据划分和泄漏证据。"

msgid "**Open:** Classify → Classifier Evaluation."
msgstr "**打开：** 分类 → 分类器评估。"

msgid ":ref:`Classify <workflow-module-classify_merged>`: Use the matching held-out predictions and split metadata."
msgstr ":ref:`Classify <workflow-module-classify_merged>`: 使用匹配的留出集预测和数据划分元数据。"

msgid ":doc:`API reference </api/spacr/classifier_evaluation/index>`."
msgstr ":doc:`API 参考 </api/spacr/classifier_evaluation/index>`。"

msgid "`Module tutorial <tutorials/#lesson=39_classifier_evaluation>`__."
msgstr "`模块教程 <tutorials/#lesson=39_classifier_evaluation>`__。"

