msgstr "解释 CV 模型"

msgid "Fit a measured-feature surrogate to existing computer-vision scores, preserving identity joins. A surrogate explanation is not causality."
msgstr "用实测特征拟合现有计算机视觉评分的代理模型，并保留标识关联。代理模型的解释不代表因果关系。"

msgid "**Open:** Classify → Explain CV Model."
msgstr "**打开：** 分类 → 解释 CV 模型。"

msgid ":ref:`Classify <workflow-module-classify_merged>`: Select CV predictions and the matching measured objects."
msgstr ":ref:`Classify <workflow-module-classify_merged>`: 选择 CV 预测及匹配的已测量对象。"

msgid ":doc:`API reference </api/spacr/surrogate/index>`."
msgstr ":doc:`API 参考 </api/spacr/surrogate/index>`。"

msgid "`Module tutorial <tutorials/#lesson=70_explain_cv>`__."
msgstr "`模块教程 <tutorials/#lesson=70_explain_cv>`__。"

