msgstr "激活"

msgid "Apply the matching image classifier and preprocessing to inspect saliency/model-response maps."
msgstr "使用匹配的图像分类器和预处理配置，检查显著性图或模型响应图。"

msgid "**Open:** Classify → Activation."
msgstr "**打开：** 分类 → 激活。"

msgid "**Image attribution maps** — Saved model-response/saliency images for the matching classifier and input preprocessing."
msgstr "**图像归因图** — 为匹配的分类器和输入预处理保存的模型响应图或显著性图。"

