msgstr ":ref:`Classify <workflow-module-classify_merged>`: 同时提供匹配的裁剪图像及通道预处理配置。"

msgid ":doc:`API reference </api/spacr/deep_spacr/index>`."
msgstr ":doc:`API 参考 </api/spacr/deep_spacr/index>`。"

msgid "`Module tutorial <tutorials/#lesson=16_activation>`__."
msgstr "`模块教程 <tutorials/#lesson=16_activation>`__。"

