msgstr ":ref:`Annotate <workflow-module-annotate>`: 为同一批对象选择相互独立的标注列。"

msgid ":doc:`API reference </api/spacr/agreement/index>`."
msgstr ":doc:`API 参考 </api/spacr/agreement/index>`。"

msgid "`Module tutorial <tutorials/#lesson=23_agreement>`__."
msgstr "`模块教程 <tutorials/#lesson=23_agreement>`__。"

msgid "Computer Vision"
msgstr "计算机视觉"

msgid "Train an image classifier from labelled object crops, archives or supported streamed crops. Match channels and preprocessing when applying its checkpoint."
msgstr "根据带标签的对象裁剪图像、归档文件或受支持的流式裁剪图像训练图像分类器。应用其检查点时，应匹配通道和预处理配置。"

msgid "**Open:** Classify → Computer Vision."
msgstr "**打开：** 分类 → 计算机视觉。"

msgid "`Module tutorial <tutorials/#lesson=10_classify_cv>`__."
msgstr "`模块教程 <tutorials/#lesson=10_classify_cv>`__。"

msgid "Tabular Machine Learning"
msgstr "表格机器学习"

msgid "Train a feature-based classifier from measured objects and labels. Inspect missing-feature exclusions and grouped held-out performance before using scores."
msgstr "根据已测量对象和标签训练基于特征的分类器。使用评分前，检查因缺失特征而被排除的对象，以及按组留出评估的性能。"

msgid "**Open:** Classify → Tabular Machine Learning."
msgstr "**打开：** 分类 → 表格机器学习。"

msgid "`Module tutorial <tutorials/#lesson=11_classify_ml>`__."
msgstr "`模块教程 <tutorials/#lesson=11_classify_ml>`__。"

msgid "Parameter Sweep"
msgstr "参数扫描"

msgid "Run explicitly selected regression settings and compare their diagnostics. Keep the input data and evaluation question fixed."
msgstr "运行明确选定的回归设置并比较其诊断。保持输入数据和评估问题不变。"

msgid "**Open:** Regression → Parameter Sweep."
msgstr "**打开：** 回归 → 参数扫描。"

msgid ":doc:`API reference </api/spacr/parameter_sweep/index>`."
msgstr ":doc:`API 参考 </api/spacr/parameter_sweep/index>`。"

msgid "`Module tutorial <tutorials/#lesson=73_parameter_sweep>`__."
msgstr "`模块教程 <tutorials/#lesson=73_parameter_sweep>`__。"

msgid "Toxoplasma"
msgstr "弓形虫"

msgid "Open the organism guide from Home, inspect the compartment diagram, then select Plaque Assay, Recruitment, Invasion Assay or Replication Assay. The four Coming soon tiles describe proposals and cannot run. The guide itself does not analyse a project or produce a measurement table."
msgstr "从 Home 打开生物体指南，查看区室示意图，然后选择 Plaque Assay、Recruitment、Invasion Assay 或 Replication Assay。四个标记为即将推出的入口描述的是提议功能，无法运行。指南本身不会分析项目或生成测量表。"

msgid "**Open:** Home → Toxoplasma."
msgstr "**打开：** 主页 → 弓形虫。"

msgid "**Bundled organism reference** — Installed organism descriptions and SwissBioPics cell diagrams; no project input is required."
msgstr "**内置生物体参考资料** — 已安装的生物体描述和 SwissBioPics 细胞示意图；无需项目输入。"

msgid "**Organism guide and assay selection** — GUI-only compartment highlights and navigation to available assays; no measurements or files are produced."
msgstr "**生物体指南和实验分析选择** — 仅在 GUI 中显示的区室高亮及可用实验分析的导航；不会生成测量值或文件。"

msgid ":doc:`API reference </api/spacr/qt/screens/organism_screen/index>`."
msgstr ":doc:`API 参考 </api/spacr/qt/screens/organism_screen/index>`。"

msgid "`Module tutorial <tutorials/#lesson=82_toxoplasma>`__."
msgstr "`模块教程 <tutorials/#lesson=82_toxoplasma>`__。"

msgid "Endodyogeny size proxy"
msgstr "内二芽殖面积代理"

msgid "Read measured compartment areas, annotate conditions and bin area ** 1.5 into log2 size doublings. Defaults aggregate pathogen area per host cell, not per vacuole: multiple vacuoles in one cell are combined. This is an area-derived size proxy, not measured volume or a parasite count. Use Replication Assay with explicit vacuole identity for parasites-per-vacuole counts. Configure compartment, area filters, calibration, conditions and grouping before calling the API; saving is optional."
msgstr "读取实测区室面积，标注条件，并将 area ** 1.5 按 log2 大小倍增区间分箱。默认按宿主细胞汇总病原体面积，而非按液泡：同一细胞中的多个液泡会合并计算。这是由面积推算的大小代理指标，并非实测体积或寄生虫数量。如需每个液泡的寄生虫计数，请使用 Replication Assay 并提供明确的液泡标识。调用 API 前配置 compartment、面积过滤、标定、条件和分组；保存结果是可选的。"

msgid "**Use from Python:** :func:`spacr.submodules.analyze_endodyogeny`. This API-only workflow has no Home tile or menu entry."
msgstr "**在 Python 中使用：** :func:`spacr.submodules.analyze_endodyogeny`。这是仅提供 API 的工作流程，没有主页磁贴或菜单项。"

msgid "**Host-cell-aggregated compartment areas** — Each src project root/measurements/measurements.db; tables defaults to cell, nucleus, pathogen and cytoplasm, with png_list added for merging. The compartment setting selects the area column; default pathogen_area is summed per host cell. Relevant tables, depending on the route: ``cell``, ``nucleus``, ``pathogen``, ``cytoplasm``, ``png_list``. Relevant columns, depending on the route: ``cell_id``, ``pathogen_area``."
msgstr "**按宿主细胞汇总的区室面积** — 每个 src 项目根目录下的 measurements/measurements.db；表默认为 cell、nucleus、pathogen 和 cytoplasm，并为合并添加 png_list。compartment 设置选择面积列；默认对每个宿主细胞求和 pathogen_area。相关的表（视路线而定）：``cell``、``nucleus``、``pathogen``、``cytoplasm``、``png_list``。相关的列（视路线而定）：``cell_id``、``pathogen_area``。"

msgid "**Area-derived size-proxy results** — Returned data and chi_squared DataFrames; save=True also writes data.csv, chi_squared_results.csv, chi_squared_pairwise_results.csv and a figure under the first project root/results/analyze_endodyogeny/. Relevant columns, depending on the route: ``pathogen_area``, ``pathogen_volume``, ``pathogen_volume_bin``, ``bin_index``."
msgstr "**由面积推算的大小代理指标结果** — 返回的 data 和 chi_squared DataFrame；save=True 时还会在第一个项目根目录的 results/analyze_endodyogeny/ 下写入 data.csv、chi_squared_results.csv、chi_squared_pairwise_results.csv 和一张图。相关的列（视路线而定）：``pathogen_area``、``pathogen_volume``、``pathogen_volume_bin``、``bin_index``。"

msgid ":ref:`Measure <workflow-module-measure>`: Supply the measured project roots and required object/png_list tables. Verify host-cell aggregation and area units before interpreting size bins; the Mask counts database alone is insufficient."
msgstr ":ref:`Measure <workflow-module-measure>`: 提供已测量的项目根目录及所需的对象表和 png_list 表。解释大小分箱前，核实宿主细胞汇总方式和面积单位；仅有 Mask 计数数据库并不足够。"

msgid "Direct Cellpose mask generation"
msgstr "直接生成 Cellpose 掩膜"

msgid "Run a stock or custom Cellpose model on TIFF fields through the Python API. Despite its historical identify_masks_finetune name, this function performs inference, not training. Review normalization, channels, resizing and model parameters; masks are written only when save is enabled. Import compatible image/mask pairs through External Masks before Measure, or curate the pairs before training. This call does not build a Measure-ready merged project."
msgstr "通过 Python API，在 TIFF 视野上运行标准或自定义 Cellpose 模型。尽管其历史名称为 identify_masks_finetune，该函数执行的是推理而非训练。检查归一化、通道、尺寸调整和模型参数；只有启用 save 时才会写出掩膜。在 Measure 前通过 External Masks 导入兼容的图像与掩膜对，或在训练前整理这些配对。本调用不会创建可直接用于 Measure 的合并项目。"

msgid "**Use from Python:** :func:`spacr.spacr_cellpose.identify_masks_finetune`. This API-only workflow has no Home tile or menu entry."
msgstr "**在 Python 中使用：** :func:`spacr.spacr_cellpose.identify_masks_finetune`。这是仅提供 API 的工作流程，没有主页磁贴或菜单项。"

msgid "**TIFF fields for direct Cellpose inference** — Top-level, lowercase .tif files in src; existing same-name files in src/masks are skipped. Supply the configured channels and a compatible stock model_name or custom_model checkpoint."
msgstr "**用于直接 Cellpose 推理的 TIFF 视野** — src 顶层中扩展名为小写 .tif 的文件；跳过 src/masks 中已存在同名文件的图像。提供配置的通道及兼容的标准 model_name 或 custom_model 检查点。"

msgid "**Direct Cellpose TIFF masks** — When save=True, src/masks/<image-name>.tif contains integer labels. The call returns None and does not produce merged arrays or measurements.db."
msgstr "**直接生成的 Cellpose TIFF 掩膜** — 当 save=True 时，src/masks/<image-name>.tif 包含整数标签。调用返回 None，不会生成合并数组或 measurements.db。"

msgid ":ref:`Cellpose Workbench <workflow-module-train_cellpose>`: Pass the trained checkpoint as custom_model with the matching image channels and preprocessing."
msgstr ":ref:`Cellpose Workbench <workflow-module-train_cellpose>`: 将训练好的检查点作为 custom_model 传入，并匹配图像通道和预处理配置。"

msgid ":ref:`External Masks <workflow-module-external_masks>`: Provide the saved label TIFFs and their original images to External Masks, assign object roles and create the merged project before Measure."
msgstr ":ref:`External Masks <workflow-module-external_masks>`: 向 External Masks 提供保存的标签 TIFF 文件及其原始图像，指定对象角色，并在 Measure 前创建合并项目。"

msgid "Pooled-screen simulation sweep"
msgstr "混池筛选模拟扫描"

msgid "Use the Python sweep API to explore stated screen-design assumptions. It expands combinations, runs simulations in a process pool and writes synthetic summary statistics; it returns None. Set a small explicit max_workers value and a bounded parameter grid before running. The output does not replace measurements or barcode counts for experimental Regression. Use the findings as planning evidence, with their assumptions recorded. Review the synthetic summaries when choosing planning assumptions; transfer those assumptions manually into Power / Design or Experiment Design. Neither tool imports this simulation database, and neither exports the simulation settings grid."
msgstr "使用 Python 扫描 API 探索明确陈述的筛选设计假设。它展开参数组合，在进程池中运行模拟，并写出合成汇总统计；返回值为 None。运行前设置明确且较小的 max_workers 值和有界参数网格。输出不能代替实验 Regression 所需的测量值或条形码计数。将结果作为规划依据，并记录其假设。选择规划假设时，检查合成摘要；手动将这些假设转入 Power / Design 或 Experiment Design。两个工具都不导入此模拟数据库，也不导出模拟设置网格。"

msgid "**Use from Python:** :func:`spacr.sim.run_multiple_simulations`. This API-only workflow has no Home tile or menu entry."
msgstr "**在 Python 中使用：** :func:`spacr.sim.run_multiple_simulations`。这是仅提供 API 的工作流程，没有主页磁贴或菜单项。"

msgid "**Pooled-screen simulation assumptions** — Python settings dictionary: iterable sweep values for screen size, occupancy, classifier accuracy and sequencing assumptions, plus replicates, src, name, variable, plot and max_workers. generate_parameters expands their Cartesian product; begin with a small sweep and an explicit worker bound."
msgstr "**混合筛选模拟假设** — Python 设置字典：筛选规模、占据率、分类器准确率和测序假设的可迭代扫描值，以及 replicates、src、name、variable、plot 和 max_workers。generate_parameters 展开它们的笛卡尔积；请从小规模扫描和明确的工作进程上限开始。"

msgid "**Synthetic screen simulation summaries** — src/<YYMMDD>/<name>/simulations.db; the sweep appends summary rows to simulations and optionally writes plots. These are synthetic performance estimates, not measured experimental hits. Relevant tables, depending on the route: ``simulations``."
msgstr "**合成筛选模拟摘要** — src/<YYMMDD>/<name>/simulations.db；扫描会向 simulations 追加汇总行，并可选择写入图表。这些是合成的性能估计，而不是实测的实验命中项。相关的表（视路线而定）：``simulations``。"

msgid ":doc:`API reference </api/spacr/sim/index>`."
msgstr ":doc:`API 参考 </api/spacr/sim/index>`。"

msgid "Host–Pathogen Analysis"
msgstr "宿主–病原体分析"

msgid "Measure whole vacuoles and host reference compartments, keeping uninfected host cells for the infection denominator. Select marker channels and control-calibrated ratio thresholds. Optionally count individually segmented parasites from explicit vacuole links or a measured count column. Review vacuole, host and well tables, joint marker states, replication distributions and unmatched parasite links; unknown measurements remain unknown."
msgstr "测量完整空泡和宿主参考区室，并将未感染的宿主细胞保留在感染比例的分母中。选择标记通道和通过对照校准的比值阈值。可选择依据明确的空泡关联或已有的实测计数列，对单独分割的寄生虫进行计数。检查空泡、宿主和孔的表格、联合标记状态、复制分布以及未匹配的寄生虫关联；未知测量值仍保留为未知。"

msgid "**Open:** Toxoplasma → Host–Pathogen Analysis."
msgstr "**打开：** 弓形虫 → 宿主–病原体分析。"

msgid ":ref:`Measure <workflow-module-measure>`: Keep uninfected cells in Measure. Supply whole-vacuole masks, host reference intensities and optional explicit parasite-to-vacuole links; host identity alone does not define a vacuole."
msgstr ":ref:`Measure <workflow-module-measure>`: 在 Measure 中保留未感染的细胞。提供完整空泡掩膜、宿主参考强度以及可选的明确寄生虫–空泡关联；仅凭宿主身份不能定义空泡。"

msgid ":doc:`API reference </api/spacr/host_pathogen/index>`."
msgstr ":doc:`API 参考 </api/spacr/host_pathogen/index>`。"

msgid "`Module tutorial <tutorials/#lesson=85_host_pathogen>`__."
msgstr "`模块教程 <tutorials/#lesson=85_host_pathogen>`__。"

